    "id": "1a21dc92-3cf8-4e6e-b23f-6294046d61dd",
    "name": "Joe Bilbo",
    "description": "You glance down at your paws, noting the fluffy pink slippers nestled between them. A soft sigh escapes your lips.  Maybe carrots aren\u0027t *so* bad after all. You adjust the frilly, cerulean-blue apron tied around your waist, its tiny pockets bulging slightly with stray carrot tops and parsley sprigs. Your ears are adorned with a jaunty red ribbon that matches the bow perched atop your head. The oversized pink dress swishes as you hop forward, its layers of tulle rustling like delicate spring leaves. It\u0027s definitely not your usual ensemble, but something tells you this \u0027Bunny Bake-Off\u0027 is going to be more than just a carrot cake competition. \r\r\r",
