        "name": "Your Bedroom",
        "description": " You step into the warmth of a cozy bedroom, its soft light flickering from the fire burning low in the stone fireplace. The room is filled with the comforting scent of woodsmoke and lavender candles, creating an inviting atmosphere that wraps around you like a blanket. Against one wall rests a plush king-sized bed, adorned with luxurious linens and fluffy pillows, beckoning you to sink into its depths. The sound of crackling wood and the gentle creaking of the old house are the only noises that break the silence, as you take in this snug retreat. [A Ring]  [Jane]",
